A||||12||Pyric||Side scoops, what do you think?||||1||
Z||000000||Pyric||11-30-2001||08:06 AM||||This is more of an opinion thread...<BR>I wanted to know which of these side scoops you all liked the best.  I was trying to decide.<P>The first is here: <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierowarehouse/fullpanel.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fierowarehouse/fullpanel.html</A> <P>The second is here: <A HREF="http://www.heartland_fieros.homestead.com/files/club_merchandise/DadsSideScoops.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://www.heartland_fieros.homestead.com/files/club_merchandise/DadsSideScoops.jpg</A> <P>There are some others Here: <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierofiber/rrscoops.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fierofiber/rrscoops.html</A> <BR>And Here: <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierofiber/rockers.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fierofiber/rockers.html</A> <P><BR>Thanks,<BR><p>[This message has been edited by Pyric (edited 11-30-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000001||Oreif||11-30-2001||08:26 AM||||I have the ones from Fiero Warehouse (007DOUG's site). These are excellent panels. Sage is the person that makes them and when they say "ready to paint" they mean it. The scoops fit perfect and look great. All the holes are pre-drilled and the scoop face is cut out. (Spend the extra to have the screens put in.) When I got mine they went to the body shop for painting and within a few days I had them back. They were even impressed with the quality of the scoops.<BR>I cannot say anything about the others you posted because I don't know anyone who has ordered from them. I have seen a few from others and quality of the finish is a big issue. Many others still require some finishing work before they can be painted.<BR>The fierofiber ones look like they need to have the scoop face cut and all the holes drilled for mounting, plus need the finishing work done.<BR>As for the "Pontiac" style (the single scoop) or the "mechum" Style (the ribbed scoop) it is a matter of preference. I have seen both styles and they both look good.<P>Hope this helps.<P>------------------<BR>            <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg">          <BR><FONT SIZE="1"><B><I>Happiness isn't around the corner...<BR>Happiness IS the corner.</I></B></FONT>||||reg||1
Z||000002||FieroBUZZ||11-30-2001||08:33 AM||||I have Sage's scoops as well.  They are extremely well made.  I like the clean uncluttered look. I also agree with Oreif on the other styles available, becomes a matter of taste.  BTW, I believe the fine auto in the first link is Oreif's ride  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>Gary||||reg||14
