Z||000009||SLAMMED87GT||11-30-2001||03:07 PM||||The "Rockers" are nice and at the price they are selling them for I would like them on my car. <P>However, they are not the same as the IRM rockers becasue of the fact that the IRM ones stick out below the door farther and stick out in front of the door as shown in the pic here.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fieroshow1_1.jpg"> <BR> <BR>Although, I've heard it takes a mighty long time to get parts from IRM and they are priced at like $800 a pair.<P>I would like to get the integrated rockers eventually on my '87GT, then I will sell my genuine HOLLEY scoop for like $300. <P>By next summer it should be worth that much right?!!?!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Pfierosig_1.jpg">  <P>------------------<BR>3" Drop, 17" Primax 618s/Nitto540 205/40, 4" Monza exhaust, Mudstain decklid scoop, 7" wing stands, Clear front and rear lights, custom interior, all options...that's all hehe.<p>[This message has been edited by SLAMMED87GT (edited 11-30-2001).]||||reg||6
