Z||000012||Pyric||11-30-2001||05:41 PM||||Not to steer my own topic in a different direction, but I was also considering a hood vent like this one: <A HREF="http://www.fortunecity.com/silverstone/impala/403/fieroparts.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fortunecity.com/silverstone/impala/403/fieroparts.htm</A> <P>Mostly because it may stop the fiero's "front end liftoff" that it has at high speeds. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I'm still trying to decide on the side scoop.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>Does anyone have the rocker panel Scoops from specialty Auto?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif"><BR>||||reg||1
